{
  "id": "/",
  "name": "Al-Qur'an Digital — Teras Qur'an",
  "short_name": "Teras Qur'an",
  "description": "Baca Al-Qur'an 30 juz dengan teks Arab, latin, terjemahan, tafsir Kemenag RI, audio murottal per ayat, jadwal murajaah hafalan, jadwal sholat, kiblat, dan tasbih digital.",
